    {
      "num": 7,
      "geez": "አሌ፡ ለክሙ፡ ኃጥኣን፡ እለ፡ ማእከለ፡ ባሕር፡ ወዲበ፡ የብስ፡ እለ፡ ዝክሮሙ፡ እኩይ፡ ዲቤክሙ።",
      "translation": "Woe to you, ye sinners, who live on the mid ocean and on the dry land, Whose remembrance is evil against you.",
